    {
      "id": "p0168-b004",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "IF YOU SEE A SHOP, YOU SHOULD STOP. .. DROP, AND ROLL... INTO SOME GREAT DEALS!! BECAUSE WE'RE HAVING A FIRE SALE!! AT MY IMAGINARY STORE, WHICH SELLS FLAMES.",
        "raw": "IF YOU SEE A SHOP, YOU SHOULD STOP. .. DROP, AND ROLL...\nINTO SOME GREAT DEALS!! BECAUSE WE'RE HAVING A FIRE\nSALE!! AT MY IMAGINARY STORE, WHICH SELLS FLAMES.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.33552217,
          0.26677143,
          0.85041879,
          0.31602143
