    {
      "id": "p0168-b006",
      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "I heard \"stop, drop, and roll\" so often as a kid that it almost felt like catching on fire was a common problem we'd all face daily when we grew up - same with quicksand, too",
        "raw": "I heard \"stop, drop, and\nroll\" so often as a kid\nthat it almost felt like\ncatching on fire was a\ncommon problem we'd\nall face daily when we\ngrew up - same with\nquicksand, too",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.11537848,
          0.33227143,
          0.26599505,
          0.4507
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.11405182,
          0.33155714,
          0.26732171,
          0.45177143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          23,
          24,
          26,
          28,
          30,
          32,
          34,
          35
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "我小时候听“停下、趴下、打滚”听得太多，差点以为长大后身上着火会是天天遇到的问题——流沙也是一样。",
